  "scope": "Correct the pressure diagnostic export dimensions without changing its data, claims, panel selection, common kPa scale or physical axes. The shared style default savefig.bbox=tight cropped the original183x145mm canvas to163.055x139.449mm; that frozen original and its earlier readability inspection remain intact. The renderer now explicitly disables automatic cropping and draws all nonzero parent facets inside verified polar limits against the matching zero-pressure background, excluding only zero polygons outside the figure. Actual SVG dimensions are183x145mm;600dpi PNG dimensions, editable SVG text, embedded TrueType PDF marker and fresh rendered visual/text checks pass. This companion supersedes only the first figure size claim/artwork. All original CPU support, double-spreading and paired elastic results remain unchanged. No physical simulation or production engine is rerun or edited, and the extended goal remains active.",
  "payloads": 25,
  "payload_bytes": 924845
